*Type:** Command":"## task/next\n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## task/terminate **Type:** Command":"## task/terminate\n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## tool/bandwidth-server/session **Type:** Directory":"## tool/bandwidth-server/session \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000Reboots the router when the system stops responding(the software watchdog timer) or when one IP address stops answering pings(the ping watchdog), and writes a support output file after a software failure. See [Watchdog](LINK).":"当系统停止响应（软件看门狗定时器）或某个 IP 地址停止响应 ping（ping 看门狗）时重启路由器，并在软件故障后写入 support 输出文件。请参阅 [Watchdog](/docs/7.25/diagnostics-monitoring-and-troubleshooting/watchdog)。","docs-7.25\u0000The [`ssh-exec`](LINK) command is a non-interactive SSH command, allowing you to execute commands remotely on a device through scripts and scheduler.":"[`ssh-exec`](/docs/7.25/management-tools/ssh#run-remote-commands-from-scripts) 命令是非交互式 SSH 命令，允许通过脚本和调度器在设备上远程执行命令。"}}
